# Upstream OpenWrt snapshot feeds are intentionally DISABLED on this device.
#
# This firmware uses a custom kernel (6.18.44) and toolchain, so the rolling
# snapshot packages can pull a libc/kmod combination that does not match the
# running kernel.  The device-specific signed feed and the local feed in
# customfeeds.list are the supported sources.
#
# The upstream URLs are kept here for reference only:
# https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/targets/mediatek/mt6990/packages/packages.adb
# https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a55_neon-vfpv4/base/packages.adb
# https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a55_neon-vfpv4/luci/packages.adb
# https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/packages/aarch64_cortex-a55_neon-vfpv4/packages/packages.adb
